<title>USA: N.Y. State $395 mln dorm deal at 6.25 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State $395 mln dorm deal at 6.25 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
